  "notes": "{席|せき} means a seat, place, or occasion/gathering.\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- {座席|ざせき}: seat\n- {空席|くうせき}: vacant seat\n- {満席|まんせき}: full, no seats available\n- {指定席|していせき}: reserved seat\n- {自由席|じゆうせき}: unreserved seat\n- {席順|せきじゅん}: seating order\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {席|せき}を{取|と}る: to get a seat\n- {席|せき}を{譲|ゆず}る: to give up one's seat\n- {席|せき}を{外|はず}す: to step away (from desk/seat)\n- この{席|せき}は{空|あ}いていますか: Is this seat free?\n\nEXTENDED MEANING:\nお{酒|さけ}の{席|せき} means a drinking occasion/party, not just a physical seat.",
